---
import './hireme.scss';
---

<main class="main-page-content hireme-page">
	<h1 class="hireme-title">Howdy! 🤠</h1>
	<section class="hireme-section">
		<p>
			Welcome to my "Hire Me" page. If you've landed on this page, you've likely been linked to it by me, or you've delved into some serious detective work.
		</p>
	</section>
	<section class="hireme-section">
		<h2 class="hireme-section-title">Current Role</h2>
		<p>
			I am currently employed as a Staff Software Engineer at <a href="https://www.varomoney.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer">Varo Bank</a>. During my tenure there, I've bounced around different projects and teams but lately have been focusing on building out our suite of Lending products.
		</p>
		<p>Some things I've worked on include:</p>
		<ul class="hireme-list">
			<li>
				Re-building our new app(s) in React Native with Expo and our new Design System.
			</li>
			<li>Established AI tooling standards (AGENTS.md templates, prompt/eval practices, agentic workflows) and drove adoption across teams.</li>
			<li>
				Integrating <a href="https://statsig.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer">Statsig</a> as our feature and experiment platform.
			</li>
			<li>
				Led the web efforts to promote the <a href="https://www.apollographql.com/docs/technotes/TN0032-sdui-basics/" rel="noopener noreferrer">server-driven UI</a> architectural pattern.
			</li>
			<li>Integrated with Column Tax for <a href="https://finance.yahoo.com/news/varo-rolls-free-tax-prep-120838379.html?guccounter=1&guce_referrer=aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbS8&guce_referrer_sig=AQAAANmSeTGnVURdC1SN5lnuRdpNQYL6XnENjL2fV6YFW7w8L0QOeLm1oNhffFzEn42tuRL1C-5fvuDsDXHVlxux2bsAhYCs212Si9AQaWam0qxfhPCRLtItbVwesotZI2lYY5F3_H-M_Wr6YKQSd-JU6JuGuuuKRJnsHMY9xUAfk4Rh" rel="noopener noreferrer">tax prep purposes</a>.</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			My code typically gets shipped to production once a week. I primarily work with technologies such as: TypeScript, React, React Native (Expo), GraphQL with Apollo and React Testing Library with Jest on the frontend and Kotlin, PostgreSQL, GraphQL, Node.js and gRPC on the backend.
		</p>
	</section>
	<section class="hireme-section">
		<h2 class="hireme-section-title">Previously</h2>
		<p>
			Before my tenure at Varo, I held positions as a Senior Full-stack/Front-end Developer at <a href="https://www.tzero.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer">tZERO</a> and <a href="https://www.overstock.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer">Overstock.com</a>. In those roles, I spearheaded projects using technologies such as React, Redux, NodeJS, Express, and PostgreSQL on the backend.
		</p>
	</section>
	<section class="hireme-section">
		<h2 class="hireme-section-title">Working Style</h2>
		<p>
			Although I primarily focus on the frontend and client-side code, I consider myself a well-rounded Engineer with the ability to work across the entire tech stack and do so independently. My staff engineering archetype is "the fixer," which means I usually get thrown on projects to help get them across the finish line or to solve ambiguous problems and unblock teams. I spent most of my career working with web technologies but recently found out I really enjoy React Native and the mobile space. I have a strong love for the UI aspects of client-side Engineering and possess keen attention to detail, whether it pertains to design or code. This attention to detail is what I consider my "superpower."
		</p>
	</section>
	<section class="hireme-section">
		<h2 class="hireme-section-title">Education</h2>
		<p>
			My academic background includes a Bachelor of Science degree in Strategic Communication from the University of Utah, as well as an Associate of Science degree from Salt Lake Community College.
		</p>
	</section>
	<section class="hireme-section">
		<h2 class="hireme-section-title">Interested In</h2>
		<p>
			Some current technologies that interest me: TypeScript, React, React Native, Expo, Astro, NextJS, RemixJS, Bun, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui and Redix UI. Would love to work with these in my next role.
		</p>
	</section>
	<section class="hireme-section">
		<h2 class="hireme-section-title">Outside of Work</h2>
		<p>
			Outside of work, I take pleasure in spending time outdoors with my dog, Arto, and my girlfriend, Jordan. I also have a passion for cycling and running. For more on that, check out my <a href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/256235" rel="noopener noreferrer">Strava</a>.
		</p>
	</section>
	<section class="hireme-section">
		<p>
			Thank you for your consideration, and I look forward to further discussion. Cheers 🤙
		</p>
	</section>
	<div class="hireme-actions">
		<a class="back-link" href="/">Home</a>
		<a class="back-link" href="/resume">Resume</a>
	</div>
</main>
